    ]
  },
  "$conflicts": [
    "Numbers where sources disagreed, and why this file reads the way it does.",
    "",
    "Gaul Theutates Thunder attack is 100, not 90. 90 is Travian Kingdoms, a",
    "different game with its own balance — the one trap in using a Kingdoms",
    "table for Legends, and this file fell into it once already.",
    "Gaul Haeduan defence vs infantry is 60, not 50; 50 is the pre-T4 value.",
    "Hun Marksman is 110 attack at speed 15. The 115/16 pairing comes from the",
    "retired Travian Answers page as it stood in 2018 and was rebalanced after.",
    "Natar Birds of Prey defends 10 against infantry and 0 against cavalry.",
    "Roman settler costs 4600/4200/5800/4400; the higher figure still on some",
    "tables is T3.6. The same pages carry T3.6 training times, 25% longer.",
    "",
    "Held at low confidence: Natar carrying capacity (10 here, kirilloid says 0,",
    "and no official source publishes it — Natars never raid, so it is",
    "untestable), and the Egyptian Ash Warden's 1380s training time, which fits",
    "the official level-20 figure where the alternative 1320s does not."
  ],
  "$smithy": [
    "Travian's level-20 comparison tables can be back-solved to base values with",
    "up = base + (base + 300 * crop / 7) * 0.149, which reproduces every unit",
    "whose base figure is published independently. It is how the Egyptian and",
    "Natar transcriptions here were cross-checked against a second source."
  ],
